{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>NOTICE: Our game requires two controllers to play.</i><br><strong><i>To play online, please use Steam remote play.</i> </strong> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE PURRFECT COMPETITION!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OVERCAT makes full-on <strong>competitive gaming accessible to beginners</strong>, boasting a system where being dramatically better or worse than your opponent leads to <strong>even more exciting matches!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of skill diffing your friends in repetitive, predictable matches? OVERCAT is the game for you and all your friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MEOW MEOW MEOW MEOW MEOW MEOW MEOW!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OVERCAT features <strong>15 different playable characters</strong>, each with their own special ability! Find your main kitty-cat across a range of <strong>painted environments</strong>, while listening to an <strong>original soundtrack of nothing but bangers!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A BOSS FIGHT AGAINST YOUR FRIENDS!?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OVERCAT features a special mechanic to bring a <strong>unique twist to your typical fighter</strong>, where you can <strong>choose between two different power levels!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as an <strong>Overcat</strong> for a <strong>massive boost to your fighting power!</strong> Your friends won't stand a chance against your bonus abilities and health!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or are you feeling cocky? Then choose <strong>Undercat</strong> instead - a weaker option that rewards <strong>double points for going against the odds!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What will you choose? And what will your opponent choose!?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954490/extras/abcb592ee2e3dee894e944e6091f1890.poster.avif?t=1766770437\" width=480 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954490/extras/abcb592ee2e3dee894e944e6091f1890.webm?t=1766770437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OVERCAT OST by charb, follow them on soundcloud!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3954490?t=1766770437","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3954490?t=1766770437","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954490/c53736cc2c030e63753b587c50ccc94bdc74e44f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766770437","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954490/c53736cc2c030e63753b587c50ccc94bdc74e44f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766770437","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>NOTICE: Our game requires two controllers to play.</i><br><strong><i>To play online, please use Steam remote play.</i> </strong> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE PURRFECT COMPETITION!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OVERCAT makes full-on <strong>competitive gaming accessible to beginners</strong>, boasting a system where being dramatically better or worse than your opponent leads to <strong>even more exciting matches!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of skill diffing your friends in repetitive, predictable matches? OVERCAT is the game for you and all your friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MEOW MEOW MEOW MEOW MEOW MEOW MEOW!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OVERCAT features <strong>15 different playable characters</strong>, each with their own special ability! Find your main kitty-cat across a range of <strong>painted environments</strong>, while listening to an <strong>original soundtrack of nothing but bangers!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A BOSS FIGHT AGAINST YOUR FRIENDS!?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OVERCAT features a special mechanic to bring a <strong>unique twist to your typical fighter</strong>, where you can <strong>choose between two different power levels!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as an <strong>Overcat</strong> for a <strong>massive boost to your fighting power!</strong> Your friends won't stand a chance against your bonus abilities and health!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or are you feeling cocky? Then choose <strong>Undercat</strong> instead - a weaker option that rewards <strong>double points for going against the odds!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What will you choose? And what will your opponent choose!?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954490/extras/abcb592ee2e3dee894e944e6091f1890.poster.avif?t=1766770437\" width=480 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954490/extras/abcb592ee2e3dee894e944e6091f1890.webm?t=1766770437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OVERCAT OST by charb, follow them on soundcloud!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph